Z||000014||MontanaFiero||03-24-2001||04:41 AM||||well said...<P>About public executions.... In the early nineties, a public execution was set to take place here at our court house on the front lawn. They even had the platform built. This was at the request of the death row inmate..... At the last minute, he decided he wanted lethal injection instead-- and was granted.<P>JK-- How could everything be wrong?? I understand from your previous posts that you don't agree with religious stuff, but surely you don't think an un- disciplined kid is going to behave, do you? A kid's gotta be taught right and wrong. I'm not saying beat 'em, but somehow the message has to get accross. That's what job the parents' were given... By God or otherwise.||||reg||1
